 "section_summary": "This section contains educational surveys and administrative records compiled by the Supreme Commander for the Allied Powers (SCAP) Civil Information and Education Section for post-war Japan. It concludes the institutional roster and statistics for Nara Prefecture, detailing village elementary schools and kindergartens, private academies, ministerial training facilities, and an educational reference map of Central Honshu. Following a Department of State routing slip concerning missing despatch enclosures, the section presents the initial portion of the report for Gumma Prefecture, including an administrative introduction, summary tables by jurisdiction and level, and institutional listings for national and prefectural secondary and higher schools.",
