   "start_page": 214,
   "summary": "This concluding portion of the educational roster for Nara Prefecture provides detailed data for village and town elementary schools and kindergartens, private institutions across all levels, and specialized schools operated by non-educational ministries. Entries list school names, addresses, founding dates, and sex-disaggregated student enrollment and teacher numbers for April and November 1946. The report concludes with an educational map of Central Honshu showing major population centers and prefectural capitals.",
   "title": "Roster of Japanese Educational Institutions: Nara Prefecture",
