   "start_page": 248,
   "summary": "This opening portion of a SCAP report on Gumma Prefecture begins with an overview of Japan's post-war educational structure, followed by twelve summary tables analyzing student and teacher distributions across jurisdictions and school levels. It then presents institutional roster entries for national colleges and normal schools, attached elementary schools, and prefectural vocational, middle, and girls' high schools. Each entry records founding dates, locations, enrollment statistics, and faculty counts for April and November 1946.",
